பிரிந்தோர்","lemma":"piri","gloss":"those who are separated"}],"gloss":"those who are separated"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கையற","parts":[{"text":"கை","lemma":"kai","gloss":"means / hand"},{"text":"அற","lemma":"aṟa","gloss":"to cease / be lost"}],"gloss":"helplessly"},{"surface":"நரலும்","parts":[{"text":"நரலும்","lemma":"naral","gloss":"crying / sounding"}],"gloss":"crying"},{"surface":"நள்ளென்","parts":[{"text":"நள்","lemma":"naḷ","gloss":"midnight / intense"},{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"sounding / saying"}],"gloss":"silent / midnight"},{"surface":"யாமத்து","parts":[{"text":"யாமத்து","lemma":"யாமத்து","gloss":"at midnight"}],"gloss":"at midnight","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருந்தண்","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தண்","lemma":"பெருந்தண்","gloss":"great cold"}],"gloss":"great cold","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாடையும்","parts":[{"text":"வாடை","lemma":"vāṭai","gloss":"north wind"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and the north wind"},{"surface":"வாரார்","parts":[{"text":"வாரார்","lemma":"varu","gloss":"he does not come"}],"gloss":"he does not come"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இஃதோ","parts":[{"text":"இஃது","lemma":"iḥtu","gloss":"this"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ō","gloss":"interrogative particle"}],"gloss":"is this indeed?"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"நம்","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"nam","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதலர்","lemma":"kātalar","gloss":"lover"}],"gloss":"lover"},{"surface":"வரவே","parts":[{"text":"வரவு","lemma":"varavu","gloss":"arrival"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"arrival"}]}],"literal":"Fire-like red-headed anril bird, / with its female bird having a prawn-like curved beak, / from the nest on the high branch of the taṭavu tree, to those who are separated, / cries helplessly in the silent midnight. / Even during this great cold north wind, he does not come. / Is this, O friend, our lover's arrival?","translation":"The red-headed anril bird, bright as fire, along with its mate whose curved beak is like a prawn, cries from its nest on the high branch of the taṭavu tree, making those who are separated feel utterly helpless. In this silent midnight, even as the great, cold north wind blows, he does not return. Is this, my friend, how our lover keeps his promise to return?","modern":"நெருப்பைப் போன்ற சிவந்த தலையையுடைய அன்றில் பறவை, இறாலைப் போன்ற வளைந்த மூக்கையுடைய தன் பெண் பறவையோடு, தடவ மரத்தின் உயர்ந்த கிளையிலுள்ள கூட்டில் இருந்துகொண்டு, பிரிந்திருப்பவர்கள் செயலற்று வருந்துமாறு நள்ளிரவில் கூவுகிறது. இத்தகைய குளிர்ந்த வாடைக் காற்றுக் காலத்திலும் நம் காதலர் வரவில்லை. தோழியே! நம் காதலர் திரும்பி வருவதாகச் சொன்ன வரவு இதுதானோ?","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend in a state of deep distress. Her lover had departed to earn wealth, promising to return before the onset of the cold season, but he has not yet arrived. She describes the anril bird, famous for its inseparable devotion to its mate, nesting high in the taṭavu tree. The bird's cries in the silent midnight torment her, emphasizing her own painful solitude. The cold north wind (vāṭai) further intensifies her grief, making her wonder if this painful waiting is all that remains of his promised return.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.07,1.5],[1.5,1.97],[1.97,2.4],[2.4,2.99],[2.99,3.5],[3.5,4.18],[4.18,4.4],[4.4,5.5],[5.5,6.0],[6.0,6.75],[6.75,7.2],[7.2,7.2],[7.2,7.7],[7.7,8.7],[8.7,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,9.2],[9.2,10.8],[10.8,11.3],[11.3,11.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.43,2.1],[2.1,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.76],[3.83,4.2],[4.2,5.03],[5.03,5.3],[5.3,6.7],[6.7,7.2],[7.2,7.92],[8.4,8.64],[8.64,8.64],[8.64,9.6],[9.6,10.5],[10.5,10.8],[10.8,11.2],[11.2,12.5],[12.5,13.1],[13.1,13.6],[13.6,13.8]]},"sync":[[["நெருப்பின்","fire-like"]],[["நெருப்பின்","fire-like"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["செந்தலை","red-headed"]